# INT-SOURCE: ../functional/55_regcall.my
# INT-ENGINES: default
# INT-CONFIGS: MYLANG_JIT_OFF=hoist2 ; MYLANG_JIT_OFF=cache ;
#   MYLANG_JIT_OFF=resreg ; MYLANG_JIT_OFF=capprot ; MYLANG_JIT_OFF=peep ;
#   MYLANG_JIT_OFF=telide ; MYLANG_JIT_OFF=vfquiet
#
# INT unit (#107): the REGCALL program (frameless callees whose arguments
# arrive in registers) with one JIT lever off at a time - the levers
# whose OFF arm only this program reaches: hoist2 (a second hoisted base),
# cache (no register pins at all), resreg, capprot, peep, telide and
# vfquiet. A lever changes only how fast the code runs (CLAUDE.md, the
# lever switches), so each configuration must still pass the program's
# own asserts. corpus_diff --levers runs every lever over the corpus;
# this is the part of it the coverage universe counts.
